\label{fig:forest-chain}
\end{figure}

\section{SAT locality: projected distance versus worldtube adjacency}

SAT has historically taken a stronger position than merely saying that a four-dimensional block description is globally defined. A foundational SAT as
...[truncated]...
\section{What is actually connected, and what is not yet connected}

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{>{\raggedright\arraybackslash}p{0.30\textwidth} >{\raggedright\arraybackslash}p{0.24\textwidth} >{\raggedright\arraybackslash}p{0.34\textwidth}}
\toprule
Statement & Current status & What would strengthen or kill it \\
\midrule
Information about an actual referent requires a realized physical ancestry & Foundational principle; formalized by channel/processing language & Clarify edge cases involving global constraints and quantum causal structure; no purely formal counterexample can work unless it carries a physical anchor somewhere \\
Mathematical post-processing cannot manufacture referential information absent in its physical inputs & Standard data-processing structure & Track all background variables $K$ rather than pretending ``pure math'' has no inputs \\
Hagalaz tuple $(\Delta c,\sigma,Q)$ is a coherent relation representation & Narrowly multiply verified project result & Recover/define the actual Hagalaz dynamics and internal state $\mathcal P$ \\
Three-circle tangent step is $2\pi/3$ & Exact Euclidean geometry & None; interpretation is the open part \\
$B=3/(4\pi)=1/(2\Delta_3)$ & Exact identity under the declared two-sided normalization & Derive the factor of two from geometry rather than choose it post hoc \\
Triswale sign tracks helix chirality & Candidate symmetry mapping & Solve the three-boundary contact/deformation problem and compute $A_3(s)$ \\
Chirality crossover coincides with discrete/continuous crossover & Exact only in an idealized zero-thickness parameterization & Replace pitch by true finite-tube clearance and distinguish contact from fusion \\
Local twist determines global torus winding/closure & Structurally plausible through holonomy & Define the actual toroidal path, edge law, and closure sector; compute $Q_\gamma$ \\
Particle count follows torus winding count & Speculative & Supply a forced occupancy/quantization map $f(N)$ \\
Worldtube-transverse transmission explains Bell correlations & Foundational SAT hypothesis, not demonstrated & Build an explicit causal/statistical model reproducing Bell/CHSH behavior while respecting operational no-signalling \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

\section{Immediate research program}

The Forest becomes useful only if it constrains the next calculations. The immediate sequence is:

\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=1.6em]
\item \textbf{Define native locality.} Specify the SAT/\HsH worldtube adjacency relation $\sim_W$ and the degrees of freedom that actually transmit a physical difference transverse to ordinary time propagation.
\item \textbf{Give Hagalaz dynamics, not just coordinates.} Determine whether the physical channel is an evolution of $\mathcal P_i$, a transport law on $Q_{ij}$, a constraint on a whole path, or something else.
\item \textbf{Solve the exact three-circle/tube deformation.} Derive $A_3(s)$ from explicit geometry and finite-thickness contact rather than assuming linearity.
\item \textbf{Audit $B$.} Test whether the factor-of-two normalization in Eq.~\eqref{eq:Bn} is forced by paired tangents/chiral branches or whether the equality is merely an attractive algebraic coincidence. Compare against the historical genealogy of $B$.
\item \textbf{Compose around the donut.} Place the local relation on a toroidal path and compute the holonomy/winding closure law. Determine which quantities are integer, continuous, signed, or gauge-dependent.
\item \textbf{Only then test particle proxies.} Ask whether the threefold signed sectors produce any robust $uud/udd$-like invariant, proton/neutron-scale ratio, or global matter/antimatter bias. Do not tune the geometry to the target numbers.
\item \textbf{Bell benchmark.} Write the explicit joint probability model for the proposed worldtube-transverse channel. Determine exactly which Bell-locality assumption is changed and verify no controllable superluminal signalling in the observed projection.
\end{enumerate}

\section{Conclusion}

The throughline is not ``information is abstract, geometry is physical, and perhaps they resemble one another.'' It is the opposite. Information about an actual thing is itself a physical relation: a physically realized path of dependence, recording, transformation, and transmission. Mathematics can operate on that relation but cannot conjure the referent into its symbols.

SAT/\HsH then makes a sharp additional wager: ordinary spatial separation may fail to capture native physical adjacency because extended worldtubes possess a transverse connectivity along which real influence can propagate. If that wager is correct, nonlocality is not pathlessness; it is locality in a geometry whose edges are not the edges of the ordinary projected picture.

Hagalaz is a candidate language for those edges. Threefold circle geometry supplies a particularly simple local structure with a $120^\circ$ tangent hierarchy and an exact candidate appearance of $B=3/(4\pi)$. Twisting that structure produces a signed triswale/helix sector and therefore a possible local chirality variable. Composing the local relation around a toroidal path produces the natural mathematical object for global chirality and closure: holonomy.

That is the Forest hypothesis in its present form:
\begin{equation}
\boxed{\begin{gathered}
\text{information path} \equiv \text{physical path} \subset \text{worldtube relation geometry};\\
\text{local geometry composes into global closure}.
\end{gathered}}
\end{equation}
Everything after the first semicolon remains to be earned by explicit geometry and dynamics.

